  "description": [
    {
      "ja": "『新機動戦記ガンダム W Endless Waltz』より、大鎌を携えたガンダムデスサイズヘルが、重厚なメッキ加工を施した限定仕様で登場！",
      "en": "From \"Mobile Suit Gundam W Endless Waltz\", Gundam Death Scythe Hell carrying a scythe is now available in a limited edition with heavy plating!"
    },
    {
      "ja": "• デスサイズヘルを象徴する翼をはじめ、外装の一部パーツには、重厚な輝きを放つメッキ加工を採用！",
      "en": "• Some of the exterior parts, including the wings that symbolize Death Scythe Hell, are plated to give off a deep shine!"
    },
    {
      "ja": "• 頭部アンテナには艶消し金メッキ加工を採用し、高級感を演出！",
      "en": "• The head antenna uses matte gold plating to create a luxurious look!"
    },
    {
      "ja": "• 翼には展開&ロック機構を搭載。はばたく姿やクローズ状態を自然に再現可能！",
      "en": "• The wings are equipped with a deployment and locking mechanism. It is possible to naturally reproduce the flapping appearance and closed state!"
    },
    {
      "ja": "• カトキハジメ氏によるマーキングシールが付属！",
      "en": "• MarkingSeal by Hajime Katoki is included!"
    }
  ],
